window.products.push({"id":1030128,"name":"LED Light USB Mini Cool Bottle humidifier/Aromatherapy Essential Oil Diffuser (Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rncQHdG5L._AC_.jpg","description":"Melt Away Stress, Relax and rejuvenate with this aromatherapy Mist Diffuser/Humidifier. Using this Cool Mist Essential Oil Diffuser/Humidifier is an enjoyable and effective way to experience Aromatherapy Mist humidifying in your home. Through this Ultrasonic Air diffusion with Ionizer one or two drops of water-based essential oil can deliver therapeutic aromatherapy while clearing the air and creating a pleasantly fragrant environment. For uplifting mood enhancement, any citrus can work wonders. For stress relief, add geranium and lavender. To promote some romance, try jasmine, ylang ylang, rose, sandalwood or patchouli. Don't worry -- nervousness can be soothed with frankincense. Diffusers disperse essential oils as a fine vapor throughout known as ionizing the air so they can be absorbed gently into the body through the respiratory system.  This cool bottle design ultrasonic humidifier/diffuser is equipped with automatic settings that will turn off after 4 hours.** Essential oils are not included.  Package Includes: 1 x Bottle Shape 180ml Humidifier 1 x Bottle Shape 180ml Humidifier 1 x USB Cable 1 x USB Cable 1 x User Manual 1 x User Manual Instructions: Fill the bottom with water (and optional essential oils) Fill the bottom with water (and optional essential oils) Put the humidifier cap back on the bottle,wait for a couple minutes for the filter stick to get soaked. Put the humidifier cap back on the bottle,wait for a couple minutes for the filter stick to get soaked. Plug the humidifier USB cable into any convenient power source (car, laptop or port *not included) Plug the humidifier USB cable into any convenient power source (car, laptop or port *not included) Click once to turn on lift and humidifier. Twice to turn off led light. Thrice to turn off unit. Note: if no fog, then turn bottle upside down for 3 secs to (re)soak the filter. Click once to turn on lift and humidifier. Twice to turn off led light. Thrice to turn off unit. Note: if no fog, then turn bottle upside down for 3 secs to (re)soak the filter. ENJOY! ENJOY! Note: After using the product, clean the atomizer with a damp tissue to remove impurities After using the product, clean the atomizer with a damp tissue to remove impurities Clean water tank and put it in a cool, dry place Clean water tank and put it in a cool, dry place Do not place the product in high temperature environments. Do not place the product in high temperature environments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rncQHdG5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CareyOn!","source_asin":"B071RHK8L9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071RHK8L9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071RHK8L9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1030129,"name":"Duralex - Lys Square Stackable Bowl With White Lid 14-cm (5 1/2 in)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JGTMmZFKL._AC_.jpg","description":"Founded in 1929, Duralex has been manufacturing glassware and tabletop products in La Chapelle-Saint-Mesmin, a city in the heart of France. Since 1939, when Duralex invented the glass tempering process, the name Duralex has been associated with resilient glassware, thanks to their proprietary tempering process. The Lys glass is the perfect weight, functional yet stylish and feels extremely comfortable in the hand. They are equally suitable for cold or hot drinks, conveniently stackable, impact and chip resistant, microwave and dishwasher safe. With the help of continuous investments and commitment to quality, Duralex has reached a level of excellence that makes its products recognized throughout the world. Duralex is and will always remain a true French manufacturer of glassware and tabletop products, and is the only glass manufacturer that makes 100 percent of their products in France.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JGTMmZFKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duralex","source_asin":"B00LCAATLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LCAATLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LCAATLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
