window.products.push({"id":1030197,"name":"UDMug Car Commuter Travel Coffee Ceramic Cup with Splash Proof Slider Lid, Silicone Sleeve & Built-In Coaster, 14 fl.oz (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZGHxKeH0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Click to see the Double Wall Version: https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CZCCPRM Premium Ceramic This tumbler is made from high-grade porcelain clay with more than 1260 degree heats, very premium and durable. With its High density , you can even clean it in the second day and will not remain any coffee stains. Of course porcelain is one of the best material to enjoy your coffee. Built-In Coaster At the bottom of the mug, there is a silicone boot. So soft that it can be as a coaster to protect your table or vehicle cup holders, and it will not slip to damage your countertops. You don't even need to buy another coaster. Drip Free Between the coaster and the cup there is a thin groove. It's designed to catches drips. Many coffee cups will leave coffee stains on the table after you drink. This thin groove will keep droplets in place so there’s no need to worry about coffee stains. No more a ruined table or smeared papers! One-hand Operation The Splash-proof slider lid is made from Polypropylene Plastic, 100% BPA-FREE. It's designed to Easy one-hand operation. You can slide the lid to open or close with one hand. Image that when you are driving, waiting for the green light, one hand on the wheel, you can use the other hand to slide the lid and drink directly. So convenient, you don't have to rotate the lid with two hands. On The Go There is a slight sag at the middle of the cup, the silicone sleeve will get stuck and have no place to run. You can take it to everywhere as a travel mug, holds approximately 14 oz convenient for coffee on-the-go. It's perfect for the commute & office. Convenient & Safe Dishwasher safe. Cleaning manually is recommended, easy to clean and all the silicone parts are allowed to take out. Microwaves safe, you can put this mug in the microwave to reheat the coffee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZGHxKeH0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UDMug","source_asin":"B0776X4FLJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030197","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0776X4FLJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0776X4FLJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
