window.products.push({"id":1030237,"name":"Name cups personalized, mug personalized name, customize coffee mug, customize fathers day gift, magic mug personalized photo, personalized fathers da","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YH9TIOacL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Good Morning Coffee: - Always start your day with a refreshing cup of coffee? Start your day with a smile with this fun printed coffee / Tea Mug. The perfect size to enjoy your morning beverage and the perfect gift for your loved ones on their special day. Sublimation that Lasts! We use a process called \"sublimation\" in order to create these beautiful Mugs. This leaves the image looking saturated with vibrant color and full of life. We print the image out on special paper and wrap the Mug being careful to note where the image should be showing up. From there, we compress the cup and bake the image right into the ceramic. This means your Mug will last through all those morning refills! Create your own design! You send us your picture and wording through the \"Customize Now\" button and let us to the heavy lifting while designing a cohesive and spectacular Mug. You can also be more specific with your order! Remember, Mugs are printed double sided. The uploaded image will be printed on the front and back of the Mug.! If you're a Photoshop wizard, create your own collage and text and send the whole thing over as a single image. Just remember to send a high quality photo. What we get is what we'll print and if the photo is not a great quality, unfortunately, it will turn out that way on the Mug as well. Standard size Mug holds all your coffee or tea! These Mugs hold up to 11 oz of liquid. The original color of the Mug is white, so if there is white in your picture, the material of the Mug will show through. They are made of 100% ceramic which means they are dishwasher and microwave safe! We will ship it to you in a crush proof box and wrap it in all the protective material that it needs in order to ensure a safe arrival.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YH9TIOacL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OMGSHIRTS","source_asin":"B084KTDQ73","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084KTDQ73","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084KTDQ73","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
