window.products.push({"id":1030301,"name":"Refinery Number One Germany Vertical Watercolor map Print - 11x14 - Unframed Art Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iC0KBDyKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These watercolor map prints would make for stunning and unique wall decor for your home or office. Celebrate your honeymoon destination, your favorite city, your wanderlust, your hometown, military postings, or heritage. We have taken map outlines and filled them with a variety of beautiful vistas, city skylines, and landmarks. From France to Arizona by way of Italy and New York - these prints really are stunning. We are offering these prints on artisan quality linen canvas textured card. Available in 6 sizes, from 5x7 to 13x19 - for the same low price! We have listened to feedback from our customers and added many new designs - islands in the Caribbean, more destinations in Asia, Scotland, Wales - and many more! You can also now select if you want your prints horizontal or vertical. Hang six prints together to instantly fill a large wall space with beautiful and functional art. These also look great in sets of four and three, or just two together can be a perfect pairing! One on its own will make a stunning statement piece as well. Please note the following: -The images are printed using fade resistant inks, on matte finish canvas texture card. -A frame is not included with your order. -Your print will be shipped in a rigid mailer – to ensure safe arrival at your home. -Images shown are digital versions of the illustrations, due to this fact and the variation of screen monitors, it is normal that colors might be slightly different than those on the physical print(s) you receive. ***PRODUCT DETAILS -6 Sizes & Ready to Frame Wall Art -Over 200 Destinations & New Options -Special Canvas Textured Matte Card -Perfect Gift Idea Please Note: This listing is for the print only. Any prints shown framed do not include the frames.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iC0KBDyKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Refinery Number One","source_asin":"B085H8S3B2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030301","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085H8S3B2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085H8S3B2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
