window.products.push({"id":1030304,"name":"Pure Golden Yellow Handmade 100% Natural Triple Filtered Raw Beeswax Pillar Candle 14.5oz Smokeless Eco Friendly Long Burning 60-90 Hours Size 2.75inc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41iUz6RW8YL._SL1011_.jpg","description":"Beeswax Pillar Candles Our tea light beeswax candles give off a bright cheery light and delicate honey scent. Each hypoallergenic beeswax candle is hand crafted using a lead-free 100% cotton wick and lightly filtered 100% pure beeswax from the USA . Our Pillar beeswax candles make perfect additions to many of the small places around your home like bathrooms and kitchen Honey Scented Our beeswax candles are naturally honey scented. Scent and colour varies slightly based on honey, pollen, and propolis present in the beeswax. A candle's scent throw varies based on personal sensitivities and environment. Burn time 55-60 hrs is a close approximation and will vary somewhat based on your environment and burning preferences. Our burn times are conservative averages ,not a guarantee. Results will vary. Proper wick maintenance helps. Our beeswax comes direct from beekeepers in the Cascadia where the honey bees fly among raspberries, canola, clover, and wildflowers. The resulting wax is a beautiful shade of yellow that has an aromatic honey fragrance. We simply reshape the bees' creation; the color and the scent are made by the hardworking Bees 🐝.● 100% Pure Beeswax Scented by honey, colored by pollen ● Save when you buy in bulk ● Each candle has a 4-6 hour burn time . ● Non-toxic, lead free and hypoallergenic . Beeswax emits ions which cleanse the air. ● BEAUTIFUL DECOR Add some style to your home with our high quality pure bee wax tea lights, crafted to provide a hint of glamour to any room in the house creating a truly relaxing atmosphere for all. ● GREAT FOR EMERGENCIES When the power’s out, our candles save the day!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41iUz6RW8YL._SL1011_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B076YYTS2F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030304","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076YYTS2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076YYTS2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
