window.products.push({"id":1030319,"name":"5in Long Shark Figurine Ironwood Art Carving - Coastal Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615YkzHhyjL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"This detailed figurine is carved from Sonoran desert ironwood, an extremely hard and heavy wood that is most difficult to carve. Our 5in long shark hand-carved North American olneya ironwood figurine measures 2 inches high x 5 inches long x 1.5 inches wide (approximately). The precise measurements may be slightly different as each is hand crafted. The amazing tree from which this item is crafted is a wonder of nature. Olneya tesota, also known as ironwood, gets its name from its extreme hardness and weight. This wood is very difficult to work, but patient traditional artists from northern Mexico carefully carve and etch this medium to reveal incredible detail. Subsequent sanding and polishing bring out the rich, deep grain and personality of the wood. The result is a very shiny and smooth hard finish remarkably achieved with no lacquer or varnish. This product is quite durable as well. Because of its great density, it is resistant to water, scratches and stains. This makes it easy to clean with a damp cloth. It can also be treated now and then with paste shoe polish and a light buffing to give this art piece a rich shine and bring out the intricate detail of the wood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615YkzHhyjL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunland Artisans","source_asin":"B07B8XL36X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B8XL36X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B8XL36X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
