window.products.push({"id":1030425,"name":"Dragonfly Stemless Wine Glass, Free Personalized Engraving","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iuZm9ElOL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This specialty wine glass is laser engraved with our original dragonfly design. In many cultures the Dragonfly is a symbol of adaptability and change. This is derived from the Dragonfly's ability to fly in any direction and be at home in both water and air. “I am the dragonfly rising on the wings of unlocked dreams on the verge of magical things.” – Aimee Stewart *The engraving will not fade and the glass is dishwasher friendly. *Our stemless wine glasses offer a lightweight luminous glass with a bowl large enough to enjoy the aroma of robust wines. *These glasses are clear and non-leaded. FREE PERSONALIZED ENGRAVING: We offer free personalized lettering on ALL of our glassware! There is no limit on lettering but we ask that you please consider what will fit with the design. If you would like to personalize your order, please state the following in the personalized engraving section when placing your order: 1.) What you would like engraved with spelling, punctuation and capitalization as you would like them. 2.) Where you would like the glass engraved; 1.Above the design, 2.Below the design, or 3.Opposite the design. 3.) Font selection; Old English, Celtic or Elegant (please refer to picture above in listing for examples) *We will replace any glass damaged during shipping promptly and free of charge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iuZm9ElOL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B08164PJSN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08164PJSN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08164PJSN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
