window.products.push({"id":1030443,"name":"MELANIE'S POWER Meat Thermometer, Digital Cooking Thermometer with 2 Foldable Probe, Kitchen Thermometer with Instant Read, Backlit LCD, Candy Thermom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C2LAwZHIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【ACCURATE & INSTANT READ THERMOMETER WITH LOCK FUNCTION】 - Sticking this food thermometer into the meat, it will give you an accurate reading (±1C(±2°F) at -20°C-150°C(-4°F-302°F) within 2-3 seconds. With the design of lock function, simply push the \"HOLD\" button to lock the reading to avoid its changing when you pull it out. Can be re-calibrated anytime to assure accuracy. 【UPGRADED LARGE LCD BACK-LIT DISPLAY & AUTO SLEEP】- Compared with other meat thermometer, our meat thermometer probe comes with a larger back-lit LCD screen which easily provides you a clear reading both in dim kitchen and bright outdoors. Moreover, the shutdown time can be set as your needs, which means the oven proof meat thermometer will automatically shut off within a few mintues when it not get in use. Power saving and effectively expand the lifespan of battery. 【OVEN SAGE & HIGH HEAT RESISTANCE PROBE】 - With dual probes design, you can easily use the wired long probe of this digital oven thermometer to measure the temperature of meat when you put it into the oven, grill or smoker. Supported Celsius and Fahrenheit reading modes from -50°C-300°C ( -58°F -572°F), the meat thermometer probe will enable you to get readings for both ice cube and boiling steak with ease. 【WATERPROOF & ALARM FOR PROGRAMMED TEMPERATURE】- Our digital food thermometer crafted with food grade 304 stainless steel and quality ABS material. IP67 rated waterproof and can be washed under running water without worry. Just set a temperature standard, once the food temperature reaches the one you set, the food temperature probe will send alerts and start to beeping to inform you until you manually turn it off. NEVER need to check the temperature every other time. 【MAGNETIC DESIGN & EASY TO STORE】 - With the design of built-in magnet and hanging hole, you can easily stick this meat thermometer onto your fridge which might be next to your oven to have it right at hands or just hooking it on the kitchen wall. The meat probe itself also can be folded into the handle of the oven meat thermometer which makes it portable for outdoor baking, BBQ purpose and indoor beef/lamb/chicken/pork/turkey making.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C2LAwZHIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MELANIE'S POWER","source_asin":"B09B3JBPPJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B3JBPPJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B3JBPPJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
