window.products.push({"id":1030461,"name":"Keeyra 2022 Graduation Party Decorations, Balloon Arch Kit Green Gold CONGRATS GRAD Banner Latex Balloons Supplies for College Kindergarten High Schoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A4uRxyCML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Graduation Decor for the Class of 2022 - Spice up your graduation party with balloon props! Stylish Graduation Party Supplies 2022 - Welcome your friends to your graduation party by decorating your porch/entryway and adding an extra flair to your high school or college graduation party.   Olive Green Metallic Gold Balloon Garland Arch Kit 126 Pieces add more fun and joy to your party!   How to make a balloon garland? Step 1: Blow up some balloons into different sizes with a balloon pump to get an amazing look. Step 2: Measure and cut the balloon chain to the desired length, leaving excess at each end for hanging decorations later. Step 3: Pull the balloon knot through the hole, skip a hole if the balloon is too tight. Step 4: Hang the balloon arch in the position you want. To make the look even more gorgeous, add some eucalyptus, rolled ribbons, flowers, leaves, tulle, etc.   Great Value 126 Piece Graduation Decorations: 70 x 10” Latex Balloons (10 Black, 10 White, 40 Pea Green, 10 Metal Gold) 30 x 5” Latex Balloons (10 Black, 10 White, 10 Pea Green) 4 PCS/Set x 16\" Gold 2022 Foil Balloons 1 x Mini Doctor Foil Balloon 1 x Large Doctor Foil Balloon 1 x Large Graduation Certificate Foil Balloon 16 PCS/Set x Green 'CONGRATS GRAD' Banner 1 x Dot Glue, 1 x 32.8' Ribbon, 1 x Balloon Chain   Tips: 1. Helium can only be stored in a balloon for 6-14 hours. If you are filling with helium, do not fill it a day in advance. 2. Special deodorization method: After receiving the balloon, please open the package completely. 3. The diameter of the balloon can be blown up to about 12 inches, just like a basketball. Balloons over this size can easily explode.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A4uRxyCML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Keeyra","source_asin":"B09T93QBWB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T93QBWB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T93QBWB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
