window.products.push({"id":1030576,"name":"Bodum Antigua Burr Grinder, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Y5XZN05TL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com Coffee connoisseurs know that even with excellent coffee beans, the perfect water, and a high-quality brewing machine, coffee still will not be good without the right grind. Bodum's Antigua grinder produces a superior grind by using a sharp, hand-forged, conical stainless-steel blade so that the coffee is cut rather than crushed. An inlet cover over the blade makes it easy to grind oily beans. In addition, the two-step grinding gear has a powerful motor so that the rotation is quiet and occurs at low speeds. This keeps the beans from overheating, thereby retaining the coffee's flavor and aroma. Measuring 8 by 10-1/2 inches, the Antigua is designed to be a smaller version of professional burr grinders for in-home use, occupying only as much counter space as a traditional 10-cup coffeemaker. Although the unit is compact, the bean container can hold up to 1/2 pound of coffee beans at a time. An airtight lid fits on the bean container and keeps beans from losing their aroma. Three grinding settings let drinkers choose their grind: fine for espresso, medium for filter coffee machines, or coarse for French press coffeemakers (or anywhere in between settings if an intermediate-level grind is desired). The timer/quantity control sets the number of minutes the beans will be grind, based on how many cups of coffee are being brewed, what type of beans are being used, and what the level of grind is. Both the bean container and the ground coffee container are transparent to monitor the grinding process, and the ground coffee container easily pulls out of the grinder for use. An automatic power cut-out feature prevents permanent damage to the grinder by turning off the grinding gear in the event that a stone finds its way into the Antigua. The grinding gear also can be disassembled for cleaning. The Antigua comes with adequate power cord storage beneath the unit for excess cord length and a .25-ounce coffee scoop. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Y5XZN05TL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B00006F2LP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00006F2LP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00006F2LP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1030577,"name":"Hiware 35 Oz Glass Carafe with Stainless Steel Silicone Flip-top Lid - Glass Water Pitcher Fridge Ice Tea Maker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61caI52-ZgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REAL BOROSILICATE GLASS: This carafe is made of premium borosilicate glass and is capable of temperatures from 0 to 300℉ meaning you can pour boiling water from tea kettle directly into the carafe to steep tea and coffee with no worries. Also, you can put it in the fridge for storing and cold brewing. It is totally safe and healthy for no lead, no BPA, no plastic and dishwasher safe. PERFECT SIZE IN FRIDGE: The carafe is 10\" in the whole height - the most suitable height for storing in refrigerator, the bottom width is 3.4\", not too big but enough for keeping standing steadily, the mouth width is 3.3\" and has a narrow neck for easy gripping by hand when pouring and carrying. MAGIC LID: The movable lid is made of stainless steel with silicone, no plastic in it. The top part is a floating cover which allows the cap to automatically open with force of the water pour, no need to hold the cap or anything while pouring and it has no dribbles. The silicone filter helps to keep the chunks of ice cubes, herbs, fruit fragments inside and the silicone gasket helps to seal. FOR ALL BEVERAGES: Great for decanting and storing all beverages like iced tea, sangria, fruit infused water, detox water, plain water, lemonade, cold brew coffee, tea, milk, hot cocoa, juice, soda, wine, loose leaf and sun tea. You can also use it to chill boiling water or cold brew in fridge. STYLISH BUT FUNCTIONAL: The carafe is designed classy and smooth that looks very modern and elegant on multiple daily uses or your themed party, festival drinks, tea parties, banquets and so on. The professional features makes it very convenient and sanitary and it also a good choice as a gift for housewarming and birthday.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61caI52-ZgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIWARE","source_asin":"B012N70PJI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B012N70PJI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B012N70PJI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
