window.products.push({"id":1030652,"name":"LENYEE Welcome Sign Front Door Wreath - Farmhouse Home Decor Porch Door Decorations Hanging Outdoor Hello Sign Rustic Wood Round Wreath with Eucalyptu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813jykHZEDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wooden Welcome Sign for your House: Different from the traditional welcome sign, our house sign come with vivid artificial greenery eucalyptus leaves&unique berries/white flowers, which add more colorful to your porch. Firm Plants and Bow: Most plants and bowknots choose to glue on the wood board, but our plants and bow are on the sign firmly by using nylon cable ties. The ornaments won‘t fall apart even in hot weather, you can hang it outside without any worries. You also can buy it for your family, friends as a gift. A gift ideas for homeowner, church, baby shower. Versatile Match with Wreath - 12 inch in diameter hello sign can match with the wreath in kinds of scenes. You also can decorate the welcome sign with seasonal plants as you want. Such as, you can combine our welcome sign with Christmas, Thanksgiving and Halloween wreath to welcome guests. Hello Sign or Welcome Sign - The sign has 2 sides with words. If you are not a big fan of \"welcome\", the other side is \"hello\". It can be a hello sign when you flip the board. Wonderful decorations for spring, summer, fall and winter. The sign also has the durable hemp rope that can be hanging any place you want. Premium Welcome Sign: The welcome sign made of top-class wood, and the artificial plants are handmade and assembled. Except the silk eucalyptus leaves, we add the white berries to make the plants more lifelike. Plants, bow and the welcome sign are the perfect match for farmhouse decoration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813jykHZEDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LENYEE","source_asin":"B09JYQVVC5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030652","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JYQVVC5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JYQVVC5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1030653,"name":"Dried Preserved Eucalyptus Large Leaves Stems & Lavender Flowers Bouquet,Real Fresh Blue Eucalyptus Bundle for Shower, Greenery Branches for Vase, Flo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xkflebqDL._AC_.jpg","description":"🍃[Package includes] - Selected high-quality 8 PCS natural dried eucalyptus large leaves branches, and 15 PCS of lavender. They are approximately 14-17 inches in length. These are harvested from nature, which make it common for some leaves to be imperfect. Some of the leaves are damaged, the size and shape are different, etc. 🍃[Versatile Decoration] - These Real Eucalyptus branches represent a charm and style, It will add texture to your space effortlessly, For example, Make a bohemian wedding bouquet, and turn your room into a resort! It is also perfect for house or venue decoration, such as tablescape, garden, cafe, restaurant, office, or you can DIY a Christmas door wreath to make holiday dynamic. 🍃[Perfect Complement] - It is one of the most popular plants by florists. They will look great and remain fresh for an extended period of time when used in any floral arrangement. If you have not tried putting Eucalyptus together with a dried or fresh flower arrangement then you really should try it. Eucalyptus makes beautiful arrangements that are majestic, whatever your project, eucalyptus will be a lovely complement. Perfect gift for your mother in Mother's Day. 🍃[Calming Scent] - There are no additives added to the preserved eucalyptus leaves and lavender, which make the original floral fragrance retain. The hypnotic effects makes you feel comfortable and calm, at the same time also relax you and release your stress. However the scent of the leaves will fade away over time. 🍃[Care Tips] - If you kept it in a humid environment for a long time, green & purple glycerin liquid may be separated, don't worry, that is non-toxic and harmless. If there are further questions, please contact us for a satisfactory result.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xkflebqDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gifugi","source_asin":"B0BY2DCB1C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY2DCB1C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY2DCB1C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
