window.products.push({"id":1030836,"name":"Toaster 2 Slice Wide Slot 2 Slice Toaster Best Rated with Bagel/Defrost/Cancel Function Cool Touch Black Toaster for Bread Bagel with Removable Crumb ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OG8iOSZyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Making crispy delicious breakfast become easier and efficient now with toaster 2 slice. The Bread 2-Slice Toaster brings classic design to your home. The toaster turns any bread into a toasty treat, all at your convenience. It boasts extra-wide, self-centering slots that fit many kinds of breads and bagels. One-touch cancel, bagel, and defrost buttons simplify operation, and the COLOR CRONTROL KNOB with 7 levels gives you control to make toast your way, also accommodates the hasty morning routines. How to Use this Best Toaster 2 Slice？ Step 1: Place the bread in the slot.Step 2: Set the shape control to your desired setting.Step 3：Press the lift lever down. Step 4：The lift lever will pop up automatically when toasting is finished. Toasting Technology Designed to Excite Your Taste Buds. Basic Toasting Bread Mode: 3 basic functions with Bagel/Defrost/Cancel fuction allows different kind of toasting pleasures. Indicator lights make it easy to see the selected setting at a glance. (Note: For the customer favor, the \"Bagel\" button can toast bread both side while the traditional \"Bagel\" can only toast one side.) More Favor Choice with 7-Shade Settings: The 7 different shades means different toasting timer, choose lower settings for lighter toast or higher settings for darker, crispier toast. Extra Wide Slots: 1.4\" toaster slots allow for a wide variety of items to be toasted with the Black Compact Toaster. items such as: - Sliced Bread - French Toast(Thin) - Bagels - Frozen Pancakes - Toaster Pastries Package Includes: 1 x 2-Slice Toaster 1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OG8iOSZyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hommater","source_asin":"B08YK142H1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030836","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YK142H1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YK142H1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
