window.products.push({"id":1030865,"name":"Riedel Wine Series Cabernet/Merlot Glass, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21AA4WB648L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Riedel's Sip in style with this Riedel Wine Series wine glass set. The Wine Series collection was created for customers who feel that plain stemware on a well laid table is just not decorative enough. It combines a light catching, decorative stem and Vinum's most popular bowl shapes. As each glass is expertly balanced and very sturdy, the \"Wine\" collection is appropriate for everyday use and is ideal for all users who are expanding their wine palate with exploration of many wines from many regions of the world. With this fine collection of glasses, Riedel achieves what the essence of wine and other beverage drinking is all about: enjoyment. Perfect for everyday use, these Cabernet/Merlot glasses are made by the world-renowned Germany wineglass maker Riedel Crystal and are recommended for: Bordeaux (red), Cabernet Franc, Cabernet Sauvignon, Merlot, Rioja and Tempranillo wines. 9-1/4\" H, with a 28.5 ounce capacity Amazon.com The Wine Series offers the legendary wine-enhancing qualities of Riedel glassware in an affordable yet attractive package. Bowl shapes are modeled after Riedel's popular Vinum series, but because they're machine-made from high-quality non-leaded glass, they're ideal for the novice oenophile or for everyday use. As with the Vinum series, each type of glass is carefully formed to bring out the best in a specific varietal. Here, the shape of bowl and mouth are specifically designed to enhance the flavor, bouquet and texture of full-bodied reds like Merlot and Cabernet Sauvignon. Machine-made in Europe by master glassmakers, each glass stands 9-1/4 inches tall and holds 21-1/2 ounces at full capacity. --Mary Park","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21AA4WB648L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Riedel","source_asin":"B00021YHR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00021YHR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00021YHR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
