window.products.push({"id":1030987,"name":"Cooking Utensils Set, TEMEISI 34 Pcs Wooden Handles Silicone Kitchen Utensils Set with Holder, Heat Resistant Kitchen Tools Gadgets Set with Turner To","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nZu2HpjNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎁🎁 TEMEISI 34-piece utensils set is a complete set of accessories you will need to make the maximum out of your wonderful little kitchen appliance.They will satisfy all your needs for cooking, would be your great companion in the kitchen. Each of them has its unique use. ✅ 100% BPA free premium food grade silicone Food Grade Silicone no pollutants even at high temperatures or melts like plastic, no unpleasant plastic smell. They do not discolor, warp, melt or splinter like your typical nylon or wooden spatula. ✅ No melting & High temperature resistant up to 446°F/230°C The soft silicone won’t scratch non-stick cookware or your expensive pans. Heat resistant silicone (230℃/446°F).  ✅ 100% Sturdy and durable natural wooden handles & Well touch and smoothly & Ergonomic handle design The wooden handles have great heat insulation, protecting your hands from scalding, this durable hardwood is naturally – important for the kitchen! ✅ 34 piece silicone kitchen utensils set will satisfy all your 1 x Slotted Turner &1 x Slotted Spoon 1 x Pasta Server &1 x Serving Spoon 1 x Soup ladle & 1 x Turner 1 x Spoonula &1 x Spatula 1 x Basting Brush & 1 x Whisk 1 x Tongs & 5 x Measuring Cups 6 x Measuring Spoons & 1 x Storage bucket 1 x Silicone Mat & 10 x Hooks  ✅ Warm Tips: 1. For the first time using, please wash them with warm water. 2. The best way to clean these silicone cookware is gently rinsing in warm water. 3.Never soak the wooden handle in water for long times which may result in cracks! 4. Hang them to keep them dry and avoid harboring bacteria growth after cleaning. Scroll to the top now and click Add to Cart to begin your favorite kitchen experience. Join us and make life better and better.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nZu2HpjNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEMEISI","source_asin":"B09BNFF4BF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030987","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BNFF4BF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BNFF4BF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1030988,"name":"MEDICASCRUBS Cotton Bath Towels Set - Blue 22\" x 44\" Pack of 6 Ultra Soft 100% Cotton Bath Towel Blue Highly Absorbent Daily Usage Bath Towel Ideal fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81r-zM+Ur9L._AC_SL1036_.jpg","description":"LONG LASTING PREMIUM QUALITY: Pure and natural cotton ring for softness, the 100% combed, ring spun cotton is chosen to produce luxurious , bath shower towels. The hotel quality towel is lightweight and durable, and dry off quickly while remaining resistant to wearing and tearing.the extravagant, blue bath towels set is a luxurious solution for your bathroom design, with double stitched edges and durability HIGHLY ABSORBENT: These big bath towels, posses breathable characteristics which make them perfect for your hands and body. Being terry in nature these weaves are the most absorbent of all kind with loops on both sides that create extra surface for completely drying off your hands and body. It also prevent bad odour as the wet dries off quickly and is immediately ready to be used again. PACK OFFERING: Our 6-piece bath towels sets blue, are easily washable and the bundle of 6pcs means you will have a fresh towel every day for a whole week without running out quickly, as special manufacturing process enables these extra long bath towels to be extra absorbent and dry quickly. The dimension is 22x44. MULTIPLE USE: Big bathroom towels, are ideal for multi purpose use as the premium quality makes it useable in daily routine as well as provides luxury. The big bath towels can be used by all genders of all ages, as gym towels, face cloth, hospital towels, spa towels and washcloth. Perfect for poolside, bathroom, Beach, salon, college dorm room, spa or gym use. The towel set is designed to provide users with all their basic bathroom drying needs to wrap around your hair or to dry your body. WASHING INSTRUCTIONS: Proper washing and drying are going to make sure that the bath shower towels, stay dry and useable for a longer time. We recommend washing with cold water before first use which will open up the cotton fibers, and give the towels better absorbency. Tumble dry on low heat or hang them to dry after daily use. Use of any other extensive substance could decrease the quality of the cloth, so it's better if such damaging substances are avoided as it will only reduce its softness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81r-zM+Ur9L._AC_SL1036_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEDICASCRUBS","source_asin":"B08NCXFZV1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1030988","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NCXFZV1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NCXFZV1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
